headers {
  x-user-id: {{userId}}
}

docs {
  Bill Pay API collection.

  Environments are named `<stage>-<role>` (e.g. `local-admin`,
  `prod-approver`). The stage controls `baseUrl`; the role controls
  `x-user-id` (collection-level header below). Seed user IDs are
  deterministic across deployments, so the same `<role>` selector works
  against any stage that ran the canonical seed.
}
